  "summary": "As a Software Engineer and Domain Lead at Bank of America, I specialize in building enterprise-grade applications using Angular for web development and Electron for desktop solutions. With a strong background in full-stack development, I focus on creating scalable, high-performance applications that enhance user experience and operational efficiency.\n\nOver the years, I’ve worked on critical financial systems, developing and maintaining secure, efficient, and maintainable software solutions. My expertise includes front-end architecture, API integration, and optimizing enterprise applications for performance and usability. As a Domain Lead, I collaborate with cross-functional teams to drive innovation and deliver robust software solutions that meet complex business needs.\n\nI’m always looking for opportunities to optimize workflows, mentor fellow engineers, and stay ahead of emerging technologies. Let’s connect and discuss how technology can transform the financial sector and beyond!",
